TS: MICHELLE ARNETT, RDH, BS,"}{'symbol': 'CMCSA', 'date': '2022-03-08 07:00:00', 'title': 'COMCAST NBCUNIVERSAL PROVIDES EASTERSEALS WITH $368,000 GRANT', 'text': 'CHICAGO, MARCH 8, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- EASTERSEALS ANNOUNCED IT HAS RECEIVED A GRANT OF $368,000 FROM COMCAST NBCUNIVERSAL TO ADVANCE EQUITY, INCLUSION, AND ACCESS TO EMPLOYMENT FOR YOUNG ADULTS WITH DISABILITIES PARTICIPATING IN EASTERSEALS YOUTH TRANSITION PROGRAMS IN SELECT MARKETS ACROSS THE COUNTRY.\xa0 THE GRANT WILL SUPPORT EMPLOYMENT TRAINING IN STEM-FOCUSED JOBS AND WILL PROVIDE PARTICIPANTS WITH THE OPPORTUNITY TO INCREASE THEIR DIGITAL LITERACY AS WELL AS OTHER SKILLS NEEDED TO SECURE INTERNSHIPS WITH COMPANIES IN THE CITIES WHERE THE PROGRAMS WILL BE OFFERED.'}{'symbol': 'COP', 'date': '2022-03-08 15:15:00', 'title': 'CONOCOPHILLIPS ANNOUNCES PRICING OF CASH TENDER OFFER', 'text': 'HOUSTON--(BUSINESS WIRE)--CONOCOPHILLIPS HAS ANNOUNCED PRICING OF CASH TENDER OFFER.'}{'symbol': 'COP', 'date': '2022-03-08 08:30:00', 'title': 'CONOCOPHILLIPS ANNOUNCES UPSIZING AND EARLY RESULTS OF CASH TENDER OFFER', 'text': 'HOUSTON--(BUSINESS WIRE)--CONOCOPHILLIPS HAS ANNOUNCED UPSIZING AND EARLY RESULTS OF A PREVIOUSLY ANNOUNCED CASH TENDER OFFER.'}{'symbol': 'CSGP', 'date': '2022-03-08 17:43:00', 'title': 'INTRODUCING COSTAR FOR LENDERS, A GROUNDBREAKING LIVE INTEGRATION OF DATA, MODELS AND ANALYTICS FOR COMMERCIAL REAL ESTATE LENDING', 'text': "WASHINGTON--(BUSINESS WIRE)--TODAY, COSTAR GROUP, INC. (NASDAQ: CSGP) ANNOUNCED THE LAUNCH OF COSTAR FOR LENDERS, A FULLY INTEGRATED PLATFORM THAT PAIRS A USER'S COMMERCIAL REAL ESTATE LOAN PORTFOLIO WITH THE POWER OF COSTAR'S INDUSTRY-LEADING PROPERTY INFORMATION; MARKET ANALYTICS; AND PROPRIETARY COMPASS CREDIT DEFAULT MODEL, A BEST-IN-CLASS TOOL FOR OVER 17 YEARS. USERS WILL HAVE ACCESS TO DATA FROM THE LARGEST RESEARCH ORGANIZATION IN COMMERCIAL REAL ESTATE, INCLUDING 4.6 MILLION SALE COMPS"}{'symbol': 'DG', 'date': '2022-03-08 06:55:00', 'title': 'DOLLAR GENERAL